inks a model of the building to the data that describes how it runs. ENGISOFT delivers the foundation: as-built models to LOD 500 with COBie asset data, as on the Reem Mall and ENOC staff accommodation projects, structured so it can be connected to facility management and building systems.</p></div><ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/case-studies/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Case Studies</b><span></span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/scan-to-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Scan-to-BIM</b><span>Reality capture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/bim-management/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Management</b><span>Management</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">How it runs</p><h2 class=\"h2\">From model <em>to twin.</em></h2></div></div><div class=\"flow\" style=\"--line:var(--line-d)\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Asset requirements</h3><p>Asset classes, attributes and the target FM system agreed with the owner.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">As-built model</h3><p>Model brought to as-built, from site records or Scan-to-BIM.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Asset data</h3><p>COBie and asset attributes added and checked for completeness.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Handover</h3><p>Model and data issued ready to connect to the operator&#039;s systems.</p></div></div></div></div></section>","cta":"<img class=\"bg\" srcset=\"/assets/img/dxb-dusk-960.jpg 960w, /assets/img/dxb-dusk.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/assets/img/dxb-dusk.jpg\" alt=\"Dubai skyline at dusk across the water\" loading=\"lazy\">    <p class=\"lab\">Next step</p><h2 class=\"display\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Your next project deserves <em>more than manpower.</em></h2>\n    <div c